        "He is a …",
        "Let's talk about …",
        "I want to …"
      ],
      "note": "speaker is two things in English: the person who speaks (mluvčí) and the box the sound comes out of (reproduktor). Only the sentence tells you which.",
      "note_cz": "speaker = mluvčí i reproduktor — pozná se jen z věty."
